WEBVTT

00:00.520 --> 00:04.440
<b>Ogiso Private High School</b>

00:04.440 --> 00:05.400
<b>Yuki Yokoya</b>

00:06.360 --> 00:10.070
<b>Yuki Yokoya</b>

00:08.530 --> 00:10.070
I am Yuki Yokoya.

00:11.480 --> 00:12.190
What?!

00:12.190 --> 00:14.630
Please call me Yuki.

00:16.300 --> 00:19.050
Apparently, she's Yokoya's cousin.

00:19.050 --> 00:23.330
There's a seat open right in front of him, 
so please be seated there.

00:23.820 --> 00:25.470
She's so cute!

00:28.040 --> 00:29.080
Seriously?

00:33.160 --> 00:37.220
I look forward to taking classes 
with you, Master Hitoyoshi.

00:40.010 --> 00:42.980
What?! <i>Master</i> Hitoyoshi?!

00:42.980 --> 00:44.440
<i>Oh, man...</i>

00:47.500 --> 00:50.940
Ms. Yuki! Big Brother! How was school?

00:50.940 --> 00:54.860
<b>Ogiso Private High School</b>

00:57.770 --> 01:00.540
This was all <i>your</i> doing, wasn't it?

01:01.370 --> 01:06.110
Nya-ha-ha! Consider yourself surprised!

01:06.110 --> 01:08.070
Riko!

01:09.320 --> 01:12.640
But, you know... Ms. Yuki really is amazing!

01:12.640 --> 01:15.010
She's a lightning-fast learner!

01:15.010 --> 01:18.130
I ran out of things to teach her 
after three days!

01:18.130 --> 01:21.430
Toward the end, she was even 
doing my homework for me!

01:21.710 --> 01:23.020
Right?

01:23.410 --> 01:28.570
Miss Riko praised me so much that 
I couldn't help but get a little carried away.

01:28.570 --> 01:30.490
Oh, I see.

01:30.490 --> 01:33.480
Wait, I still have a lot of questions!

01:33.480 --> 01:35.940
Like, how did you transfer in?!

01:35.940 --> 01:37.970
Where'd you pull the whole cousins thing from?

01:37.970 --> 01:40.440
And why'd you say your last name is Yokoya?

01:40.440 --> 01:43.470
Not to mention, how are you 
in the same grade as me?!

01:43.780 --> 01:48.500
And above all, why didn't you tell me 
about any of this? Stuff like that!

01:49.610 --> 01:54.670
I was able to transfer in by pulling a few 
strings through my underground connections.

01:54.670 --> 01:57.700
The cousins setup was suggested by Miss Riko.

01:57.700 --> 02:01.470
She said I would be more easily accepted 
if I claimed to be a relative.

02:01.470 --> 02:06.730
And since I am now your cousin, 
I borrowed the name Yokoya from you.

02:06.730 --> 02:10.380
I think I am a little older than you,

02:10.380 --> 02:15.200
but I thought being in the same grade 
would better allow me to serve you.

02:16.520 --> 02:19.450
And as for why I kept it all a secret, 
that was because...

02:19.450 --> 02:23.160
Miss Riko said it would be more fun this way.

02:23.160 --> 02:24.830
Yay!

02:24.830 --> 02:26.200
Riko...

02:26.200 --> 02:27.500
Seriously, I can't believe you!

02:27.500 --> 02:28.430
Ow!

02:28.430 --> 02:30.120
Uh... Um.

02:30.430 --> 02:34.840
Have I done something to upset you?

02:34.840 --> 02:41.460
Oh, no, it's not that I'm angry, 
more just... a little surprised.

02:46.190 --> 02:47.520
Ah, well.

02:47.850 --> 02:51.650
Let's enjoy a normal school life 
together, Ms. Yuki.

02:54.570 --> 02:55.480
Yes, let's!

04:31.500 --> 04:41.210
<b>Ogiso Private High School</b>

04:35.880 --> 04:41.210
Aw, yeah! It's finally time!

04:41.710 --> 04:43.130
<b>Katsuda Love</b>

04:41.990 --> 04:44.010
Here I come, Katsuda Bread!

04:44.510 --> 04:46.220
Outta the way!

04:44.510 --> 04:48.220
<b>Episode 4: You Won't Miss Out.</b>

04:46.220 --> 04:48.220
Katsuda... Bread...

04:48.600 --> 04:50.700
Ms. Yuki, what do you want to do for lunch?

04:50.700 --> 04:53.530
I was thinking of going to the 
convenience store, but...

04:53.530 --> 04:55.240
Katsuda... Bread...

04:55.240 --> 04:57.530
What?! You want Katsuda Bread?

04:58.540 --> 05:03.650
But it's in such rare supply, you need to 
dash for it the moment the bell rings...

05:04.540 --> 05:05.650
Rare...

05:05.650 --> 05:08.820
You see, the Katsuda Side 
Dish Store closes early,

05:09.140 --> 05:12.700
and there's no way for students 
to make it there in time after school.

05:12.700 --> 05:19.240
So instead, our school store serves a selection
of their bread-based items each Wednesday.

05:19.240 --> 05:21.920
And the most popular one among them...

05:22.450 --> 05:25.560
is yakisoba bread with plenty 
of Katsuda's Sauce mixed inside,

05:25.560 --> 05:27.370
commonly known as Katsuda Bread.

05:27.370 --> 05:29.550
Personally, I'm more of a 
Katsuda Sandwich fan, though.

05:29.550 --> 05:32.380
Thing is, our classroom is the farthest one 
from the school store,

05:30.350 --> 05:35.060
<b>Schoolyard</b>

05:30.350 --> 05:35.060
<b>School Store</b>

05:30.350 --> 05:35.060
<b>B Wing</b>

05:30.350 --> 05:35.060
<b>A Wing</b>

05:30.350 --> 05:35.060
<b>Pool</b>

05:30.350 --> 05:35.060
<b>Gymnasium</b>

05:32.380 --> 05:35.060
so even if we leave now, 
we'll never make it in time.

05:35.640 --> 05:37.630
Katsuda... Bread...

05:38.360 --> 05:39.520
Where is the school store?

05:39.790 --> 05:40.650
Huh?

05:40.650 --> 05:43.380
My mentor taught me something once.

05:43.380 --> 05:46.990
"Even if your prey should strike you, 
do not fail to take it down."

05:47.810 --> 05:49.950
Please do not worry, Master Hitoyoshi.

05:50.270 --> 05:53.450
I will obtain this Katsuda Bread without fail.

05:54.430 --> 05:55.700
I shall return!

05:57.660 --> 05:59.420
M-Ms. Yuki?!

06:04.410 --> 06:06.680
Wait! Hold on, Ms. Yuki!

06:06.680 --> 06:08.970
If you stand out too much... 
we'll have a huge problem...

06:08.970 --> 06:10.550
on our hands...

06:16.930 --> 06:19.080
<i>I let her go off on her own again...</i>

06:19.080 --> 06:22.650
<i>No, I couldn't have stopped her. 
There was no way I could.</i>

06:23.050 --> 06:24.070
<i>Because...</i>

06:24.350 --> 06:25.530
<i>Her face was...</i>

06:25.530 --> 06:28.860
<i>the face of a girl in a dessert shop!</i>

06:29.290 --> 06:30.570
<i>I know this all too well.</i>

06:30.570 --> 06:32.640
<i>In the pursuit of delicious desserts,</i>

06:32.640 --> 06:35.980
<i>the means, the effort, the cost—
none of that matters!</i>

06:35.980 --> 06:41.160
<i>It's no exaggeration to say that a girl's true
potential is brought out in such moments!</i>

06:41.580 --> 06:42.670
<i>What that means is...</i>

06:42.670 --> 06:47.550
<i>If it's her desire and willpower to taste 
Katsuda's Sauce that's driving her right now...</i>

06:44.040 --> 06:47.550
<b>Katsuda's Sauce</b>

06:47.890 --> 06:50.640
<i>None on this earth can stop her!</i>

06:51.280 --> 06:55.140
<i>The concept of "normal" within Ms. Yuki 
has veered off in an unexpected direction!</i>

06:56.070 --> 06:57.150
<i>That's...</i>

06:57.150 --> 06:59.440
<i>the first wave of the Katsuda Brigade!</i>

06:59.520 --> 07:08.490
<b>Katsuda Love</b>

06:59.930 --> 07:03.570
No one asked me, but clever little Riko 
is going to explain it to you anyway!

07:03.570 --> 07:05.210
The Katsuda Brigade are those who,

07:05.210 --> 07:10.000
captivated by the Katsuda Side Dish Store's 
food, will travel any distance to seize it!

07:09.530 --> 07:24.920
<b>Katsuda Love</b>

07:09.980 --> 07:24.920
Katsuda! Katsuda!

07:10.000 --> 07:12.950
They are soldiers who put their lives 
on the line for Katsuda Bread,

07:12.950 --> 07:17.710
training their leg strength and 
sprinting ability each and every day!

07:17.710 --> 07:20.540
What's more, their love for 
Katsuda Bread runs so deep

07:20.540 --> 07:24.920
that they perform a mysterious dance 
while savoring its flavor!

07:24.920 --> 07:27.130
This is bad! At this rate...

07:27.380 --> 07:29.560
<i>Ms. Yuki, who's about to drop in from above,</i>

07:29.560 --> 07:32.970
<i>is going to clash with the Katsuda Brigade 
right in front of the school store!</i>

07:32.970 --> 07:35.800
<i>I can see the future, and it's not pretty!</i>

07:38.150 --> 07:40.180
<i>She's leaping the distance?!</i>

07:41.660 --> 07:42.940
<i>No way!</i>

07:45.120 --> 07:47.200
<i>Though... This might actually...</i>

08:00.870 --> 08:02.750
<b>Croquette Bread</b>

08:01.040 --> 08:02.750
<b>Egg Sandwich</b>

08:01.160 --> 08:02.750
<b>Sandwich</b>

08:01.370 --> 08:02.750
<b>Yakisoba Bread</b>

08:01.620 --> 08:02.750
<b>Katsu Sandwich</b>

08:07.270 --> 08:12.390
May I please have one Katsuda Bread 
and one Katsuda Sandwich?

08:17.980 --> 08:20.120
I can't possibly apologize enough.

08:20.940 --> 08:25.270
They said the Katsuda Side Dish Store bread 
is limited to one per person, so...

08:30.500 --> 08:33.630
I'm fine with this croquette bread here!

08:33.630 --> 08:34.740
Still...

08:42.570 --> 08:44.040
Would you...

08:44.040 --> 08:46.150
dine upon this?

08:47.420 --> 08:49.710
No... Why don't you eat it?

08:50.460 --> 08:54.550
Is it truly all right for me 
to be the only one to do so?

08:54.900 --> 08:57.930
Yeah, go ahead. I've had it before, anyway.

08:58.300 --> 09:00.390
And you won it fair and square.

09:00.760 --> 09:02.260
Then...

09:02.260 --> 09:06.350
<i>I was going to call out her outrageous 
behavior from earlier, but...</i>

09:07.930 --> 09:10.320
<i>When I see that blissful look on her face,</i>

09:10.740 --> 09:13.540
<i>I can't bring myself to rain on her parade.</i>

09:21.000 --> 09:22.410
Master Hitoyoshi...

09:22.960 --> 09:24.830
Please have this.

09:24.830 --> 09:25.710
Huh?

09:26.440 --> 09:29.080
That'd be... Um...

09:29.670 --> 09:32.280
Please! There's no need to hold back.

09:35.560 --> 09:38.220
Then... if you'll excuse me.

09:41.400 --> 09:42.760
How is it?

09:45.380 --> 09:46.360
It's very...

09:47.210 --> 09:49.660
d-delicious.

09:53.820 --> 09:58.240
<b>Yokoya</b>

09:58.240 --> 10:02.120
Mochita, I'm sleeping over today!

10:02.460 --> 10:05.530
Didn't you already visit a whole lot 
during summer vacation?

10:05.530 --> 10:07.080
What are you talking about?!

10:07.080 --> 10:11.880
I know Ms. Yuki can do it with you 
any night she wants, but...

10:11.880 --> 10:13.060
Watch your wording!

10:13.060 --> 10:15.650
This is a big deal for someone like me

10:15.650 --> 10:17.670
who's been wanting 
a big sister this whole time!

10:18.060 --> 10:21.740
We can chat about fashion, 
stay up all night talking about love,

10:21.740 --> 10:23.780
secretly eat late-night snacks...

10:23.780 --> 10:26.310
The possibilities are endless!

10:26.310 --> 10:29.230
Just so you know, I wanted 
a big sister so badly that...

10:29.230 --> 10:35.020
at one point, I almost tried to trick myself 
in believing you were my big sister instead!

10:35.020 --> 10:37.480
Big Sister!

10:38.070 --> 10:39.010
My dear Riko.

10:39.010 --> 10:39.660
Who the heck?!

10:39.660 --> 10:41.950
And you better rein in that wild imagination!

10:41.950 --> 10:42.830
Anyway...

10:42.830 --> 10:44.830
Clever little Riko just thought of an idea!

10:45.460 --> 10:50.570
If you and Ms. Yuki got married, 
everything would work out perfectly!

10:50.570 --> 10:52.630
Why am I the one getting carried off?!

10:52.630 --> 10:54.640
Huh? Cuz I prefer it that way.

10:54.640 --> 10:55.740
You're honest, at least.

10:55.740 --> 10:59.590
But if you ask me... I think Ms. Yuki is 
in love with you, Big Brother! For sure!

10:59.590 --> 11:00.630
Huh?!

11:00.630 --> 11:03.300
Wait, wait. There's no way that's true.

11:03.300 --> 11:05.760
I don't think she's into 
romance in the first place.

11:05.760 --> 11:10.480
Nuh-uh. Who do you think understands 
a girl's heart better, you or me?

11:12.280 --> 11:14.610
B-But... The other day...

11:14.610 --> 11:17.120
she gave me some Katsuda Bread 
with total innocence in her eyes.

11:17.120 --> 11:19.070
There was nothing romantic about it.

11:19.070 --> 11:23.780
You kidding me? That's so lovey-dovey! She's 
gotta be <i>this</i> close to popping the question!

11:24.050 --> 11:25.300
Got plans for the wedding?

11:25.300 --> 11:26.980
Don't get ahead of yourself!

11:26.980 --> 11:28.870
Hmm...

11:29.360 --> 11:32.060
I know Mom would probably be okay with it,

11:32.060 --> 11:33.890
but I dunno about Dad.

11:33.890 --> 11:37.080
He's pretty stubborn, just like you.

11:37.080 --> 11:38.900
In either case, I have no—

11:38.900 --> 11:41.550
We should hold both Eastern- 
and Western-style weddings!

11:42.410 --> 11:44.850
Is someone getting married?

11:45.260 --> 11:47.000
Oh, uh... No.

11:47.000 --> 11:50.540
We were talking about how nice it would be 
if you could become my big sister for real!

11:50.540 --> 11:51.350
Riko!

11:51.620 --> 11:54.120
You like my big brother, don't you, Ms. Yuki?

11:54.120 --> 11:56.310
Riko, you little...

11:58.140 --> 12:00.830
Yes, I admire him dearly.

12:04.410 --> 12:06.930
Oh, Ms. Yuki! I want to eat a persimmon!

12:06.930 --> 12:08.530
Could you please peel it for me?

12:08.530 --> 12:09.320
Certainly.

12:12.220 --> 12:15.490
Hey... I've been wondering 
this for a while, but...

12:15.490 --> 12:17.630
You don't usually wear makeup, 
do you, Ms. Yuki?

12:17.630 --> 12:25.720
<b>Katsuda's Sauce</b>

12:19.250 --> 12:22.780
My apologies for my unsightly appearance.

12:22.780 --> 12:25.720
During the day, I wear some 
basic foundation, but...

12:25.720 --> 12:30.330
What? Every girl dreams of being able 
to look that good without makeup!

12:30.330 --> 12:32.920
I wish I could look that cute, too!

12:32.920 --> 12:34.490
Is that so?

12:35.020 --> 12:40.940
I can't say I've found my appearance 
to be of much benefit in the past.

12:40.940 --> 12:42.270
That's a good point!

12:42.270 --> 12:45.450
Beauty like yours, Ms. Yuki, 
comes with its own share of troubles!

12:45.450 --> 12:49.450
In my case, my face doesn't really stand out...

12:49.450 --> 12:53.330
But when I grow older, I'm going to buy 
lots of makeup and make myself cute!

12:53.330 --> 12:57.540
I like your face, Miss Riko.

12:59.060 --> 13:02.800
It's adorable, and expressive, and...

13:03.240 --> 13:04.590
R-Really?

13:05.230 --> 13:05.930
Yes.

13:07.490 --> 13:09.010
That makes me happy.

13:09.010 --> 13:12.850
I don't usually hear that from 
people besides Mom and Dad.

13:13.240 --> 13:16.560
Do you think I could become 
as beautiful as you, Ms. Yuki?

13:17.510 --> 13:19.060
Come to think of it,

13:19.060 --> 13:21.300
ever since I discovered tonkatsu sauce...

13:21.300 --> 13:24.040
I feel like my skin has become smoother.

13:24.040 --> 13:24.690
What?!

13:25.000 --> 13:26.990
If you'd like, please try it for yourself.

13:31.510 --> 13:33.580
Is this actually good?

13:33.580 --> 13:36.540
I think it brings out the sweetness.

13:36.540 --> 13:38.450
Like when you put salt on watermelon?

13:38.450 --> 13:40.000
You might have a point!

13:43.590 --> 13:45.470
Oh! This works surprisingly well!

13:45.470 --> 13:49.160
<i>If you ask me, you guys 
seem like sisters already.</i>

13:50.260 --> 13:54.250
<i>I'm sure it's thanks to Riko that she was 
able to adapt so easily into our daily life,</i>

13:54.860 --> 13:58.340
<i>and it might be best 
for girls to stick together.</i>

13:58.900 --> 14:03.000
Hey, Big Brother! I bet you just thought, 
"If I marry Ms. Yuki in the future,

14:03.000 --> 14:07.460
I'll be able to see this side of her every day,
won't I?" or something like that, right?

14:07.460 --> 14:08.410
What?!

14:09.040 --> 14:13.870
Marriage? I'm afraid I'm not 
familiar with such things...

14:14.300 --> 14:16.330
Please don't pressure me even harder!

14:16.640 --> 14:20.300
In Japan, once Big Brother turns eighteen, 
he can get married!

14:20.300 --> 14:23.320
Then you can officially 
become a Yokoya, Ms. Yuki!

14:23.320 --> 14:24.580
Oh, is that so?

14:24.580 --> 14:25.630
Don't put ideas in her head!

14:26.050 --> 14:30.410
Wouldn't you be happy, too, 
if you could have a bride like Ms. Yuki?

14:30.410 --> 14:31.090
Huh?!

14:31.480 --> 14:33.930
Just hypothetically!

14:35.400 --> 14:39.770
Well... Y-Yeah, I guess...

14:42.230 --> 14:45.150
Yay! He's committed now!

14:45.150 --> 14:46.190
Riko?!

14:46.780 --> 14:49.920
Ugh, just be quiet already!

14:46.910 --> 14:47.940
All right!

14:47.940 --> 14:49.940
Can't take it back now!

14:53.780 --> 14:57.370
<b>Ogiso Private High School</b>

14:55.790 --> 14:57.370
All right, quiet down!

14:58.800 --> 15:00.670
"I am a cat,

15:01.140 --> 15:02.980
but as yet I have no name."

15:02.980 --> 15:06.080
"Where I was born is entirely unknown to me."

15:06.080 --> 15:09.940
"But this still dimly lives in my memory."

15:09.720 --> 15:14.930
<i>That darn Riko barely 
left us alone all weekend.</i>

15:09.940 --> 15:12.520
"I was mewing in a gloomy, damp place,

15:12.520 --> 15:17.350
where I got the first sight 
of a creature called man."

15:14.930 --> 15:16.340
<i>Now, thanks to that...</i>

15:17.800 --> 15:20.240
Basically, from the point of view 
of an anthropomorphized cat,

15:20.240 --> 15:24.560
it portrays the strangeness of things we 
consider common sense in human society, and...

15:24.560 --> 15:26.780
You there! Don't you dare fall asleep!

15:36.980 --> 15:39.040
This wasn't what I intended!

15:39.770 --> 15:43.210
The chalk... split in two?

15:40.260 --> 15:43.260
My eyes... My eyes!

15:43.210 --> 15:47.000
That can't be, right? 
It was totally together, wasn't it?

15:43.990 --> 15:45.580
My apologies!

15:52.120 --> 15:52.970
Oww...

15:52.970 --> 16:00.930
<b>Infirmary</b>

15:54.190 --> 15:57.910
<i>I told her it was strictly prohibited 
to bring knives to school, but...</i>

15:57.910 --> 15:59.990
<i>I wonder if she doesn't feel 
at ease without them?</i>

16:01.280 --> 16:02.710
Excuse me!

16:04.110 --> 16:05.650
I got chalk in my eye...

16:06.170 --> 16:09.180
Oh, my, a new patient.

16:10.900 --> 16:13.780
Huh? What happened to Nurse Maruyama?

16:13.780 --> 16:17.680
I'm Nitta. I'll be filling in 
as school nurse from today.

16:17.680 --> 16:18.800
Nice to meet you.

16:21.410 --> 16:24.030
So, what's wrong with your eye?

16:24.030 --> 16:25.130
Um...

16:25.130 --> 16:27.860
I got hit in both eyes by pieces of chalk.

16:27.860 --> 16:29.550
A whole piece? In both eyes?

16:29.930 --> 16:31.900
It's a long story.

16:33.130 --> 16:34.220
I see.

16:34.870 --> 16:38.330
If that's the case, could you please 
sit on the bed right there?

16:38.330 --> 16:39.420
Okay...

16:41.720 --> 16:45.090
<i>She's pretty mysterious
for a school nurse.</i>

16:45.090 --> 16:48.720
Is that pretty girl a friend of yours?

16:48.720 --> 16:50.480
Or your girlfriend, even?

16:50.480 --> 16:51.210
Huh?

16:51.210 --> 16:53.940
The girl who wears a bell around her neck.

16:54.440 --> 16:58.260
I just happened to see you two 
arrive together this morning,

16:58.260 --> 16:59.830
so I was a little curious about her.

17:00.430 --> 17:02.880
Oh, do you mean Ms. Yuki?

17:03.450 --> 17:06.860
Yeah, she's a friend of mine... 
or, well, my cousin, actually.

17:06.860 --> 17:08.040
Your cousin?!

17:10.270 --> 17:12.380
Did I say something funny?

17:12.380 --> 17:15.860
No, I was just thinking 
how you look nothing alike.

17:16.260 --> 17:18.660
<i>Well, that's true.</i>

17:18.660 --> 17:23.430
But I'd say someone like you is more my type.

17:23.430 --> 17:27.970
Huh? Th-Thank you very... much?

17:27.970 --> 17:30.880
Seriously, you're like a small animal.

17:31.880 --> 17:34.150
It doesn't seem like there's 
any damage to your eyeballs.

17:35.580 --> 17:36.940
Now, then...

17:47.540 --> 17:51.920
Shall I check to see if there's 
anything <i>else</i> wrong with you?

17:51.920 --> 17:52.940
What?

17:54.700 --> 17:56.540
My dear Hitoyoshi.

18:10.980 --> 18:13.070
Wait! Wait! Wait!

18:13.070 --> 18:16.820
You're so cute when you're frightened.

18:18.140 --> 18:20.140
Where did all this come from?!

18:20.830 --> 18:23.710
Even erotic manga have more 
emotional buildup than this!

18:24.700 --> 18:26.120
Don't worry.

18:26.120 --> 18:28.650
Besides, how do you know my name?

18:28.650 --> 18:32.090
I'm going to give you the 
best first time ever...

18:32.090 --> 18:33.340
Master Hitoyoshi!

18:33.340 --> 18:35.140
Are your eyes all right?!

18:35.980 --> 18:39.590
I came as quickly as I could 
after class ended, but...

18:39.590 --> 18:39.720
<b>Make sure to wash your
hands and gargle!</b>

18:39.720 --> 18:39.760
<b>Make sure to wash your
hands and gargle!</b>

18:41.550 --> 18:46.020
<b>Make sure to wash your
hands and gargle!</b>

18:41.550 --> 18:46.440
Oh, Ms. Yuki! I was so scared!

18:46.020 --> 18:49.440
<b>Make sure to wash your
hands and gargle!</b>

18:46.440 --> 18:48.590
What happened, Master Hitoyoshi?

18:49.780 --> 18:55.190
Oh, come on! That was just a joke. 
A school nurse joke.

18:55.190 --> 18:58.040
Think about the scar you're leaving 
on this young boy's heart!

18:58.040 --> 19:03.090
But you're so cute. You're like a hamster, 
all nibbles and squeaks.

19:03.090 --> 19:04.120
Seriously?!

19:04.460 --> 19:07.330
Right? Don't you agree,

19:07.640 --> 19:08.940
Ms. "Yuki"?

19:10.520 --> 19:13.870
I'll give you some eye drops, just in case.

19:13.870 --> 19:14.950
Come on over.

19:15.760 --> 19:18.610
Please, no more weird "jokes," okay?!

19:18.610 --> 19:23.140
Oh, look at you quiver. 
You're so cute, I could eat you up!

19:23.140 --> 19:25.720
That's exactly the kind of thing 
I want you to stop doing!

19:23.140 --> 19:26.100
<b>Make sure to wash your
hands and gargle!</b>

19:26.560 --> 19:27.220
Huh?

19:32.700 --> 19:34.730
Ms. Yuki... You, too? What's going on?

19:34.730 --> 19:36.230
I don't get—

19:37.420 --> 19:38.680
Please...

19:39.070 --> 19:41.390
stay away from him.

19:41.390 --> 19:43.570
What? Does that mean...

19:43.570 --> 19:46.590
<i>If you ask me... I think Ms. Yuki is 
in love with you, Big Brother! For sure!</i>

19:46.590 --> 19:49.640
<i>Wait, wait! Does this mean that...</i>

19:50.280 --> 19:53.300
<i>Ms. Yuki is jealous?!</i>

19:56.470 --> 19:57.460
Well...

19:58.270 --> 20:03.010
It doesn't seem like a serious injury, 
but if the pain becomes severe,

20:03.010 --> 20:05.680
please be sure to go see a doctor 
as soon as possible, okay?

20:08.640 --> 20:12.080
My dear Hitoyoshi... and Ms. Yuki.

20:19.560 --> 20:21.180
M-Ms. Yuki?

20:24.470 --> 20:25.620
Master Hitoyoshi.

20:26.090 --> 20:27.110
Yesh?!

20:29.110 --> 20:31.430
My apologies for earlier.

20:31.980 --> 20:33.830
For suddenly pulling you in close like that...

20:33.830 --> 20:37.340
W-Well, I guess it did surprise me a bit.

20:38.460 --> 20:42.010
There is something 
I must tell you, Master Hitoyoshi.

20:42.010 --> 20:44.970
What?! Um, is that...

20:44.970 --> 20:49.220
<b>Big Brother   Big Brother   Big Brother   Big Brother   Big Brother</b>

20:45.370 --> 20:48.510
I-I haven't mentally prepared myself yet!

20:50.760 --> 20:55.440
That woman from earlier... 
She is in the same business as me.

20:58.060 --> 21:00.600
There's no doubt she's an assassin.

21:00.600 --> 21:01.380
What?!

21:12.110 --> 21:16.870
And here I thought you were here on work.

21:18.450 --> 21:26.010
I'll crush your little pretend family for you.
